Backport of upstream lpac 8f68d5c: fix: handling of notification with sequence number 0 correctly (#429)
https://github.com/estkme-group/lpac/commit/8f68d5c7e5c89519e831c2532134b590ed4d108f

Notification sequence number 0 was skipped by process, remove and dump. The
v2.3.0 condition differs from the one upstream replaced; the fixed line is the same.

diff --git a/src/applet/notification/dump.c b/src/applet/notification/dump.c
